 "_weapons_doc": "Every combo hit is a SWING (no thrusts, no 360): hit1 slash right->left, hit2 return slash left->right (mirror), hit3 forward overhead/diagonal power swing with longer recovery. Hitbox = forward SECTOR: radius range (world px from the hero centre; town tile 53.3 px -> sword 96 = 1.8 tiles) and arc degrees (150 for hits 1-2 / 100 for hit 3); the swing trail is drawn with exactly that radius and arc. hit2 = dedicated return-slash frames (atk2b / <w>2), sweeping across the FRONT in the opposite direction. Only exception: titleCombo['마왕'].hit3 (360 spin + sword waves). Times in 60fps ticks, distances in world px; stop = hit-stop ticks. hit3 = finishing slash: arc 100 deg for every weapon (narrow, deep forward cut; only the 마왕 title hit 3 spins), reach 1.15x hit 1, active window +60%, longer follow-through; 'strike' = [anim fraction at a0, at a1] so the swing frames line up with the active window (windup before, follow-through after).",
